# Keep the remaining root server_lib groups stable and non-overlapping. Rust
# libtest filters are plain substring matches, not module globs, so broad
# filters like "hub::" or "tasks::" can accidentally select tests from another
# module path such as "orchestration::hub::" or "orchestration::tasks::". When
# adding a root server_lib unit test here:
# - Prefer a precise module prefix that cannot appear under another group.
# - Use full test-name filters for ambiguous short module names.
# - Prefer a package wrapper test below when the test belongs to a subpackage.
